{"title": "The Many Faces of Gond", "pageid": 30678, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Many_Faces_of_Gond", "categories": ["Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Tome_X_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Book_Tome_X_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_X_Image.png.webp, /w/images/a/a7/Book_Tome_X_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Many Faces of Gond image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Book_Tome_X_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_X_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Book_Tome_X_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>The Many Faces of Gond</b> extolls upon the many names by which <a href=\"/wiki/Gond\" title=\"Gond\">Gond</a> is known.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This book is redolent with the enticing smell of paper and ink.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/38px-Books_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/50px-Books_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Books\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Books_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Gondians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gondians\" title=\"Gondians\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png/25px-Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png/38px-Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png/50px-Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gondians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png/25px-Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Item_LOOT_GEN_Metalbar_Mithral_A.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gondians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondians\">Gondians</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a bookshelf in the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a> Lab Level at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1933&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;441</span>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An excerpt from a history of Gond - the Lord of All Smiths.]\n</p><p><br>\nWhat is in a name? Many things, in fact - especially when it comes to <a href=\"/wiki/Gond\" title=\"Gond\">Gond</a>. While the gods are no strangers to changing their titles (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/20px-Mystra_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/30px-Mystra_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/40px-Mystra_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/20px-Mystra_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra</a>, make up your mind!), few can compete with the Lord of All Smiths. Boasting no less than six secret names (Aranlaerus, Balateng, Daerosdaeros, Klannauda, Mrangor, and Tattaba - covered in chapter eighty-five), the gnomes were not content with this. Instead, they chose their own name for Gond. \n</p><p><br>\nNebelun.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading this book is the only way to learn the password (Nebelun) necessary to destroy the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a> if the party does not have a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Runepowder_Bomb\" title=\"Runepowder Bomb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Runepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Runepowder_Bomb\" title=\"Runepowder Bomb\">Runepowder Bomb</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zanner_Toobin\" title=\"Zanner Toobin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png/25px-Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png/38px-Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png/50px-Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zanner Toobin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png/25px-Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Portrait_Zanner_Toobin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zanner_Toobin\" title=\"Zanner Toobin\">Zanner Toobin</a> died without providing the code.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202908\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2168/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25357/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9031/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 929349/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.239      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   49.239      1 -total\n 42.68%   21.015      8 Template:Icon_text\n 36.62%   18.034     23 Template:Trim\n 24.07%   11.853      4 Template:Icon_link\n 18.43%    9.075     10 Template:Ifempty\n 15.54%    7.653      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 14.41%    7.097      1 Template:Books\n 13.00%    6.399      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.81%    5.813      1 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30678-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202908 and revision id 361636. Rendering